---@field floatTypeOptions? gcp.contentwarehouse_v1.GoogleCloudContentwarehouseV1FloatTypeOptions Float property.
---@field integerTypeOptions? gcp.contentwarehouse_v1.GoogleCloudContentwarehouseV1IntegerTypeOptions Integer property.
